  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :&nbsp;</strong></span> has released the answer key for the Under-Graduate Entrance Test for all Central Universities for Academic Session 2026-27 Examination on the official website of the NTA recently. Applications for the NTA CUET UG Online Form 2026 were accepted from 23 February 2026, to 26 February 2026. The online examination was held on 11-31 May 2026. Candidates who appeared for this examination can download their NTA CUET UG Answer Key 2026 from the link given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">National Testing Agency (NTA)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">NTA CUET UG Answer Key 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>03 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Last Date : <strong>04 February 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>07 February 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Correction / Edit Form : <span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>09-11 February 2026</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Re-Open Form</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Application Start : <strong>23 February 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Last Date : <strong>26 February 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam Date : <strong>11 – 31 May 2026</strong><b></b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Exam City Available : <b>29 April 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Admit Card Available :&nbsp;<b>05 May 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Re Scheduled Exam Date : <strong>06 – 07 June 2026</strong><b></b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Re Scheduled Admit Card : <b>02 June 2026</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Answer Key : <b>09 June 2026</b></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; background-color: #ffcc00;\"><strong>For 3 Subject :</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">General : <strong>Rs. 1000/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">OBC, EWS : <strong>Rs. 900/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">SC, ST, PH : <strong>Rs. 800/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Outside India :<strong> Rs. 4500/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt; background-color: #ffcc00;\"><strong>For Each Additional Subject :</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">General: <strong>Rs. 400/- Each</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">OBC, EWS : <strong>Rs. 375/- Each</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">SC, ST, PH :&nbsp;<strong>Rs. 350/- Each</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Outside India <strong>: Rs.1800/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>NTA CUET UG Admissions 2026 : Age Limit</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>No Age Limit For Any Candidates</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>NTA CUET UG Admissions 2026 : Course Details</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Course Name&nbsp;</strong></span>: <span style=\"color: #000000;\">Common University Admission Test CUET UG 2026</span></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #008000;\">Exam Conduct</span>&nbsp;</strong>: National Testing Agency (NTA)</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>NTA CUET UG Admissions 2026 : </b></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Educational Qualification </b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Students who have passed / appearing Class 12th (Intermediate) Examination will be eligible for the CUET Exam 2026.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All candidates must read the official information completely before applying.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>NTA CUET UG Admissions 2026 : </b></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>University List</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Banaras Hindu University BHU Varanasi</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Aligarh Muslim University AMU</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Assam University</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Babasaheb Bhimrao Ambedkar University</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Central University of Andhra Pradesh</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Central University of South Bihar</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Central University of Gujarat</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Central University of Haryana</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Central University of Himachal Pradesh</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Central University of Jammu</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Central University of Jharkhand</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Central University of Karnataka</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Central University of Kashmir</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Central University of Kerala</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Central University of Odisha</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Central University of Punjab</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Central University of Rajasthan</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Central University of Tamil Nadu</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Dr. Harisingh Gaur Vishwa Vidyalaya</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Guru Ghasidas Vishwavidyalaya</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Hemvati Nandan Bahuguna Garhwal University</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Indira Gandhi National Tribal University</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Jamia Millia Islamia</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Jawaharlal Nehru University JNU, New Delhi</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Mahatma Gandhi Antarrashtriya Hindi Vishwavidyalaya</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Manipur University</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Maulana Azad National Urdu University</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Mizoram University</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Nagaland University</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">North Eastern Hill University</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Pondicherry University</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Rajiv Gandhi University</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Sikkim University</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Tezpur University</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">The English and Foreign Languages University</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Tripura University</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">University of Allahabad</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">University of Delhi</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">University of Hyderabad</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Visva Bharati University</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Mahatma Gandhi Central University</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Central Sanskrit University, Delhi</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Shri Lal Bahadur Shastri National Sanskrit University</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">National Sanskrit University</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Central Tribal University of Andhra Pradesh</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Sammakka Sarakka Central Tribal University</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">For complete university information, please refer to the Information Brochure.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Check NTA CUET UG Answer Key 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">In order to download &amp; check their NTA CUET UG Answer Key 2026 candidates need to go to the important link section provided below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After getting the link candidates need to click it for downloading &amp; checking their NTA CUET UG Answer Key 2026.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates will be redirected to the login page, here they are required to provide their following details-:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Roll No / Registration No</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Password/DOB</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Captcha Code (if specified)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Have to click on the “ Login “ Icon</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After providing their valid details candidates will be able to download &amp; check their NTA CUET UG Answer Key 2026.</span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates can also download &amp; check their answer key from official site of the NTA.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>NTA CUET UG Application Form 2026 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Selection will be based on Online CBT Examination.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow SarkariExam on Instagram</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" s